/*
 * OUTPOST ISLAND - a small first-person shooter for PlayStation 2
 *
 * An original game: clear a jungle island of hostile outpost guards.
 * Software raycaster drawn with gsKit flat-shaded sprites (one per screen
 * column), so it needs nothing but ps2sdk + gsKit.
 *
 * Controls (DualShock 2):
 *   Left stick / D-pad Up,Down  move        Right stick / D-pad L,R  turn
 *   R1 / R2 / Cross            shoot        Square                   reload
 *   L1 / L2                    sprint       Start                    start / restart
 */

